   Page router prefix `/intelligence`, handler `intelligence_page`; registered in
   src/front/routes/__init__.py. Template `simulation.html` -> `intelligence.html`.
5. src/front/static/simulation/ -> src/front/static/intelligence/
   `simulation.css` -> `intelligence.css`; `simulation-communities.js` ->
   `intelligence-communities.js` (class `IntelligenceCommunities`);
   `simulation-patterns.js` -> `intelligence-patterns.js` (class
   `IntelligencePatterns`). Simulation-only feature files keep `simulation-*`.
