Selecting a Group_<name> Business View (e.g. Group_Contract) in Ontology Studio
showed entities that were not members of the group, often as isolated
orphan-looking nodes. The canvas filtered with a stale hiddenEntities blacklist
only, so entities added after the snapshot (or never recorded as hidden) leaked
in. Collapse persist also grew the BV entities list from the All-map position
cache.

